    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280940</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_000&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;さんが帰ってくるまで
待ってみるか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Should we just wait for
&lt;Cless&gt; to come back...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281040</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……いや、あの教会の列に
並んだ方がいいかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Nah, I guess we gotta
get in line for the church...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ……
マクスウェルの話、
先になんとかしない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey... Shouldn't we
do something about
Maxwell, first?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281204</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>う～ん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……え……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Eh...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281332</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いいよ、もう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just forget it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281408</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、言えよ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, whatever
it is, spit it out!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>時空戦士に会うのなんて、
後でもいいでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We can just meet
the Heroes of Time
after, can't we?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたちが優先しなきゃ
いけないのは、
マクスウェルの方なんだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We need to prioritize
Maxwell, don't we?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281724</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どっちが優先とかあんのかよ！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Prioritize"!? How the hell
do you even pick a
"priority" at a time like this!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281724</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレら、
ダオスに命狙われたのに！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dhaos is trying
to friggin' kill us!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それだって、
魔術の暴走が
原因なんだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isn't that because of the
out-of-control magic, too?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281900</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんで、そんな
断言できんだよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And what makes you
so damn sure of that!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>コラコラ、
ケンカするなよ、
こんなところで</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, hey, don't go starting
a fight out here. Terrible
place for one, don't you think?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>な、なんだよ、あんた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What the hell's
your deal?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おまえたち子どもだけか？
親父さんとおふくろさんは？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you two kids here on your own?
What about your dad, or mom?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282252</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それは……えっと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's... Umm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282332</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おお！　なんだ、コイツ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh! What's
this thing?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282432</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ぼくは妖精のエトス。
この子たちの親代わりなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm Ethos, a fairy. I'm
these children's guardian.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282508</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふぅーん？　妖精？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh...? You're a fairy?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……っていうか、
親代わりだって！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Wait, what?
You're their guardian!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へぇ……
なんかすげぇな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huhh... That's
pretty crazy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>で？　何を
もめてたんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And? What were
you arguing about?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282780</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレら、&lt;Cless&gt;さんに
会いに来たんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We came here
to meet &lt;Cless&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282908</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;に？　そうか、悪いな。
あいつ、今、
&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;に行ってて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Cless&gt;? I see... Yeah,
sorry, he's gone to
&lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt; at the moment...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はい、それは聞きました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, we heard
about that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それでこれから
どうしようかで
意見が合わなくて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then we didn't agree on
what we should do next, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283132</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ケンカしてたってわけか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So you started fighting, huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283236</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283236</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Mint&gt;さんにも
会えないし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...'Cause we can't really
meet &lt;Mint&gt;, either.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283388</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、&lt;Mint&gt;も忙しいしなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, &lt;Mint&gt;'s always
pretty busy, isn't she...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283388</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_031&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>しょうがねえな。
オレでよければ、
話聞いてやるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Guess you'll have to make do
with me, if that's alright? Whatever
you need to talk about. I'm all ears!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283456</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_032&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え？　でも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? But...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283568</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まあ、立ち話もなんだから、
うちに来いよ。この近くなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh, well, we might be talking
for a bit, so come back to my
place with me. It's pretty nearby.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283736</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_035&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ついてっても、
だいじょぶかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You think it's alright
to follow him?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283808</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_036&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>危ない人とかじゃ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He doesn't
seem too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283904</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_037&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……うーん、
悪い人じゃない感じは
するけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yeah... I feel
like he's...not 
a bad person.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284068</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_038&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>聞こえてるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can hear you, y'know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284068</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_039&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>初対面で信用しろ
ってのもなんだしな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But yeah, you can't
trust everyone you
just met, after all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284068</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_040&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ま、好きにすればいいさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, do whatever
you think's best.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284132</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_041&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうする？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What'll we do?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284212</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_042&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>行こう。
いいよね、エト？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's go. That's
fine, right, Ethos?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284292</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_110_050_043&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いいけど……
気をつけてよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, it's okay...
Just be careful.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
